# Test: deeply_nested_array_and_map_changes

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /data:
    post:
      operationId: processData
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                datasets:
                  type: object
                  properties:
                    collections:
                      type: array
                      items:
                        type: object
                        properties:
                          metadata:
                            type: object
                            properties:
                              tags:
                                type: object
                                additionalProperties:
                                  type: array
                                  items:
                                    type: object
                                    properties:
                                      value:
                                        type: string
                                      priority:
                                        type: integer
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /data:
    post:
      operationId: processData
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                datasets:
                  type: object
                  properties:
                    collections:
                      type: array
                      items:
                        type: object
                        properties:
                          metadata:
                            type: object
                            properties:
                              tags:
                                type: object
                                additionalProperties:
                                  type: array
                                  items:
                                    type: object
                                    properties:
                                      value:
                                        type: string
                                      priority:
                                        type: number
                                      category:
                                        type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## Compact Mode:
## Java SDK Changes:
* `sdk.processData()`: 
  *  `request.datasets.collections[].metadata.tags.Map<Array<tag>>[]` **Changed** (Breaking ⚠️)

## Full Mode:
## Java SDK Changes:
